--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Specifications implemented
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The HTTP surface at /v2 implements the Open Service Broker API, version 2.16.
The specification is published by the Open Service Broker API project under the
Apache License, Version 2.0, at https://github.com/openservicebrokerapi/servicebroker.
No code from that project is included here; only the protocol is implemented.

The surface at /mcp implements the Model Context Protocol, published by
Anthropic under the MIT License, at https://modelcontextprotocol.io. The
reference Python SDK ("mcp") is a declared dependency of this project and is
distributed under its own licence.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party dependencies
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

bailment depends on, but does not redistribute, the packages declared in
pyproject.toml. Each is distributed under its own licence by its own authors,
including FastAPI, Uvicorn, SQLAlchemy, Alembic, Pydantic, httpx, structlog,
Typer, Rich, PyYAML, the MCP Python SDK and the "cryptography" library.

The operator dashboard under web/ depends on, but does not redistribute, the
packages declared in web/package.json, including Next.js, React, Radix UI,
TanStack Query, Tailwind CSS and lucide-react.

Run `uv pip list` or `npm ls` in a built environment for the resolved set and
its licences.
